This directory contains a number of example meshes DOLFIN XML format.
Descriptions of (some of) the meshes follow below.

cylinder.bim
---------------

dolfin-1.bim
---------------

  Mesh of a two-dimensional dolphin in a box, generated with
  MATLABs PDE toolbox.

dolfin-2.bim
---------------

  Same as dolfin-1.bim, but finer mesh.

gear.bim
-----------

  Mesh of a gear, generated with tetgen from example m744 of
  the Princeton Shape Benchmark. Original data source is
  http://www.mt.luth.se/~petert/distributed/distributed.html

  The gear is centered at (x, y, z) = (0.5, 0.5, 0.219) and is
  bounded by [0.025, 0.975] x [0.025, 0.975] x [0.025, 0.413].

